  "goodToKnow": "Der Gottesdienst is a church service: Gottesdienst feiern, in den Gottesdienst gehen. For Catholics, it's also die Messe, which also means a trade fair. Literally it means God's service: Gottes (genitive) + der Dienst. Only a small minority of Germans attend weekly, but Christmas Eve services (Christmette) are packed. Der Gottesdienst is also used for Jewish and Muslim worship."
